Task: Perform a Complete Gap Analysis to Extend the Existing Commercial Property Claims Platform to Motor Insurance

Background

The current claims platform has been developed exclusively for the Commercial Property Line of Business (LOB).

The platform contains multiple AI agents (MCP/FastAPI based) that together handle the complete claims lifecycle, including but not limited to:

* FNOL
* Document Classification
* Data Extraction
* Eligibility Verification
* Policy Coverage Verification
* Risk Assessment
* Fraud Screening
* Claim Classification
* Claim Routing
* Damage Assessment
* Evidence Validation
* External Data Verification
* Reserve Recommendation
* Repair vs Replacement
* Settlement Recommendation
* Payment Eligibility
* Payment Trigger
* Communication Agent
* Other supporting agents

The complete codebase will be provided.

The objective is NOT to rewrite the project.

The objective is to identify everything that must change so that the platform can support Motor Insurance Claims in addition to Commercial Property.

⸻

